hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1773","Narrated Ibn Abbas (may Allah be pleased with them) that the people of Quraish are not from the family of Muhammad (peace be upon him), rather they are some relatives and there is kinship. So the Prophet (peace be upon him) said to the Quraish: ""I do not ask you for anything except that you maintain good relations with me due to our kinship (and) maintain the ties of kinship."
